{"product":{"id":10529561051317,"title":"8.5' X 24' Custom Enclosed Stage Trailer Black With Black Out Marketing and Event","body_html":"\u003ch2\u003e8.5' X 24' Custom Enclosed Stage Trailer Black With Blackout Marketing and Event \u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTake your brand, event, or production on the road with this professionally engineered 8.5' x 24' Custom Enclosed Stage Trailer, designed to create an unforgettable presence at concerts, festivals, corporate events, product launches, political campaigns, and promotional tours. Built with premium materials, a spacious elevated stage, commercial-grade electrical system, and durable construction, this trailer delivers the perfect combination of functionality, reliability, and visual impact. Whether you're showcasing products, entertaining crowds, or hosting live performances, this stage trailer is built to help your business stand out while providing years of dependable service.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e8.5' x 24' Trailer Size\u003c\/strong\u003e – Spacious commercial-grade trailer offering generous room for equipment storage, event setup, and an integrated stage while maintaining excellent towing stability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e8' Interior Height\u003c\/strong\u003e – Tall interior provides additional headroom for equipment, displays, staging components, and comfortable movement throughout the trailer.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDeck-Over Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – Elevated deck-over construction maximizes usable interior width and creates a clean, unobstructed floor plan for transporting equipment and stage components.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBlack Exterior with Blackout Trim\u003c\/strong\u003e – Premium all-black finish delivers a bold, modern appearance that creates a professional presentation and serves as an excellent backdrop for custom branding or graphics.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e(2) 7,000 lb Heavy-Duty Brake Axles\u003c\/strong\u003e – Commercial-grade tandem axles provide exceptional load capacity, improved towing stability, and dependable stopping power for long-distance travel.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e100 Amp Commercial Electrical Package\u003c\/strong\u003e – High-capacity electrical system with multiple dedicated 20-amp independent circuits allows safe operation of lighting, AV equipment, displays, and event accessories simultaneously.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e50 Amp Motor Base Plug\u003c\/strong\u003e – Convenient shore power connection provides quick access to reliable external power at venues and event locations.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAluminum Mag Wheels\u003c\/strong\u003e – Premium aluminum wheels enhance appearance while reducing weight and providing long-lasting corrosion resistance.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFully Insulated Walls \u0026amp; Ceiling\u003c\/strong\u003e – Quality insulation helps maintain a comfortable interior temperature while reducing outside noise during events and transportation.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWhite Interior Wall Covering\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bright, easy-to-clean wall finish improves interior visibility while creating a clean, professional workspace.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRTP Rubber Floor Covering\u003c\/strong\u003e – Heavy-duty rubber flooring provides excellent traction, durability, and resistance to wear from equipment, foot traffic, and daily commercial use.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStandard Stone Guard Protection\u003c\/strong\u003e – Shields the trailer's front exterior from road debris, rocks, and everyday travel damage.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eExtended Tongue\u003c\/strong\u003e – Offers improved towing clearance, enhanced maneuverability, and additional room for accessories and generator placement.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIntegrated Generator Platform\u003c\/strong\u003e – Dedicated platform securely accommodates a generator, providing dependable off-grid power for remote events and venues.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e36\" x 78\" RV Entry Door with Screen Door\u003c\/strong\u003e – Comfortable entry door with integrated screen allows fresh airflow while helping keep insects outside during events.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e(5) Exterior LED Lights with Dimmer Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bright, energy-efficient exterior lighting enhances nighttime visibility while adjustable dimmers create the perfect atmosphere.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e(7) Interior LED Lights with Dimmer Controls\u003c\/strong\u003e – Premium LED lighting system provides outstanding interior illumination with adjustable brightness for presentations, staging, and event preparation.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e18' Armless Awning\u003c\/strong\u003e – Expansive armless awning creates a large shaded area for guests, vendors, registration tables, or additional event space while maintaining a sleek appearance.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e16' Integrated Performance Stage\u003c\/strong\u003e – Large fold-out stage provides ample room for live entertainment, demonstrations, speakers, product launches, and promotional presentations.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBlack Stage Railings\u003c\/strong\u003e – Durable safety railings surround the stage while maintaining the trailer's premium blackout aesthetic.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e(2) Stage Entry Gates\u003c\/strong\u003e – Convenient dual access points allow performers, presenters, and staff to enter and exit efficiently.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e(2) Black Stage Steps\u003c\/strong\u003e – Heavy-duty stair assemblies provide safe, stable access to the elevated stage for performers and event personnel.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRear Loading Ramp with Winch System\u003c\/strong\u003e – Reinforced rear ramp simplifies loading and unloading of equipment, displays, ATVs, carts, and production gear, while the integrated winch assists with heavier loads.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRear Ramp Safety Railings\u003c\/strong\u003e – Protective black railings improve safety during loading, unloading, and equipment transport.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e48\" Rear Ramp Entry Gate\u003c\/strong\u003e – Wide rear access gate allows convenient movement of equipment and personnel onto the ramp area.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e16' Stage Winch System\u003c\/strong\u003e – Heavy-duty winch assists with smooth raising and lowering of the stage, reducing setup time while improving operational efficiency at every event.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","vendor":"SLE Concessions","product_type":"Food Trailers","created_at":"2026-07-29T07:55:59-05:00","handle":"8-5x24-black-stage-trailer-34619","updated_at":"2026-09-07T14:59:57-05:00","published_at":"2026-08-08T10:17:30-05:00","template_suffix":"product-food-trailer","published_scope":"global","tags":"available, New Food Trailers, WorkMate Serial Numbers","variants":[{"id":52880231661749,"product_id":10529561051317,"title":"Default Title","price":"37599.00","sku":"CustStage-34619","position":1,"compare_at_price":"44299.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2026-07-29T07:55:59-05:00","updated_at":"2026-09-07T14:59:57-05:00","taxable":false,"barcode":null,"grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0.0,"weight_unit":"lb","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"p